of numbers and returns the biggest one.

FUNCTION biggest(numberArray)

    If numberArray is empty
        OUTPUT Array is empty
        //(or return null;)
    END IF

    SET largest_number to numberArray[0]

    FOREACH number in numberArray
        If number is bigger than largest_number
